 "text": "ABOUT US – Island-Wide Virtual Premier League\nCart Total Items ( 0 )\nCart\nSearch for:\nPro Club League\nSCHEDULE\nMATCH RESULT\nSTANDINGS\nLEADERBOARD\nPARTICIPANTS\nFUT League\nChampions League\nTRANSFER\nNEWS\nBest for driving engagement and emphasizing the competitive gaming spirit.\nForging Virtual Football Champions. The Island-Wide Virtual Premier League (IWVPL) is your home for top-tier EA FC 26 competitive action. Step onto the virtual pitch and make your mark.\nFacebook-f\nTwitter\nBehance\nYoutube\nPro Club League\nSCHEDULE\nMATCH RESULT\nSTANDINGS\nLEADERBOARD\nPARTICIPANTS\nFUT League\nChampions League\nTRANSFER\nNEWS\nLogin\nLogin\n0\nIsland-Wide Virtual Premier League > ABOUT US\nABOUT US\nABOUT\nABOUT US Island-Wide Virtual Premier League\nThe Island-Wide Virtual Premier League (IWVPL) is an independent esports organisation built by passionate gamers, for the community.\nUnlike large organisations or associations, IWVPL is operated independently with the support of our valued sponsors. Every league, tournament, event, and community initiative is organised by our dedicated team, driven by passion rather than profit.\nPRO CLUB LEAGUE\n11 vs 11\nFUT LEAGUE\n1 vs 1\nCHAMPIONS LEAGUE\n1 vs 1\nCLUB MEMBER\n0\nPLAYERS\n0\nLEAGUE\n0\nDIVISION\n0\nCOMMUNITY\nJOIN OUR COMMUNITY\nDiscord\nInstagram\nTiktok\nOur vision is simple:\nTo unite the EA SPORTS FC community across Southeast Asia on one platform.\nWe organise a variety of EA SPORTS FC competitions, including:\n• Pro Clubs (11v11)\n• 1 v 1 Competitions\n• 2 v 2 Competitions (Coming Soon)\n• More exciting tournaments and leagues in the future.\nOur primary communities are:\n• Singapore\n• Malaysia\n• Indonesia\n• Thailand\n• Brunei\nAt IWVPL, we believe every player deserves a professional, fair, and enjoyable competitive experience. Our team is committed to providing the best possible administrative support before, during, and after every competition. Whether it’s match scheduling, resolving disputes, or answering your questions, we’ll always do our best to support our community.\nAs we continue to grow, we warmly welcome:\n• New sponsors and business partners\n• Community feedback and ideas\n• Content creators and streamers\n• Volunteers who share our passion for growing the EA SPORTS FC scene\nMost importantly, we don’t want IWVPL to feel like just another organisation.\nWe want it to feel like family.\nEvery player, manager, streamer, sponsor, and supporter is an important part of our journey. We’ll celebrate your victories, help you through challenges, and continue building a community where everyone feels welcome.\nWhether you’re competing on the virtual pitch or simply hanging out in our Discord, our promise remains the same:\nIWVPL will always be here for you—both in the game and beyond it.\nOne Community. One Passion. One League.\nIsland-Wide Virtual Premier League (IWVPL).\nSPONSOR\nPROUDLY SPONSORED BY\nA special thanks to our generous partners.\nIWVPL is an independent league promoter and is not affiliated with, sponsored, or endorsed by Electronic Arts Inc. EA SPORTS and EA FC are registered trademarks of Electronic Arts Inc.\n© 2026 Island-Wide Virtual Premier League. All rights reserved.\nESSENTIAL LINKS\nABOUT US\nCONTACT\nSCHEDULE\nMATCH RESULT\nSTANDINGS\nPARTICIPANTS\nTerms of Use & Policies\nIN TOUCH\nDiscord\nInstagram\nTiktok\niwvplofficial@gmail.com"
}
